  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Voice Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity&#xa0;aims to amplify Pacific voice, by supporting Pacific Island Countries (PICs) to tell their story and influence global negotiations with greater impact by increasing technical &amp;amp; institutional capability/capacity to effectively engage in international climate change negotiations, increase &amp;amp; sustain gender equitable presence &amp;amp; visibility at international climate-related&#xa0;events, and increase PIC credibility by demonstrating commitment to the Paris Agreement goals.</narrative>
  </description>
